48_5202587497473315011_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L85E_NDK5KAQ7kNvwFpP2M5&_nc_oc=AdrFHtbzMxm9gmFUE2iglGOOi7b1Xn6LtWyXG81IN-CoC-Qzx8r--Q1fDMV1oUa5aBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOlZ8wiHsT0tk9iPKr8nYLg724crqDHUGHgoAP_YLKNqw&oe=6AC90824"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "NEW_NurseSim_Simlogic_Landscape_sep2026.png", "id": "1289918843184424", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1289918846517757_7025777987388135305_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4oRIQJPfFVEQ7kNvwENWeDv&_nc_oc=AdpBNyYVw-k5NbemA_D-EWlFMVcbCN8dEakzwf5ddwMpL7RMrppYbcukf73Mb9p4r6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMlhs6c6JV_badBttVUotEWXDsGmP4H_-P1xeJ69c2dCw&oe=6AC9079F"}, "display_name": "VR Nurse Simulation", "keywords": ["Skillupvr", "Nurse", "skillup", "nurse", "skillupvr"], "long_description": "VR Nurse Simulation is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-assessment, the NEWS2 scoring system and ISBAR communication techniques.\n\n- 8 training scenarios of different patient profiles\n- Multiplayer setup\n- English and Norwegian language options\n- Intuitive, interactive and wireless\n- Compatible with Meta Quest 2 and 3\n- NEWS2 Scoring System \n- ISBAR Communication Framework\n- Facilitator control, communication and supervision capability *\n\n* Add-on application.", "short_description": "VR Nurse Simulation is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-as